  "details": "Recently I was told that the camera component in VR will offset with the playspace, this means that if I want to use it to say, swap views, its unfortunately unusable, I want a way to have it work like on desktop, where the view is locked to the cameras position and rotation, essentially having the camera NOT move with your head, that way its easier to use in tandem with animations and constraints.",
